WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.010
Early on the first day of the week,
three women carry spices to a tomb.

2
00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:08.210
They worry: who will roll away the stone?

3
00:00:08.260 --> 00:00:11.100
But the stone is already rolled back.

4
00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:14.390
Inside, a young man in a white robe says:

5
00:00:14.440 --> 00:00:15.480
He has risen!

6
00:00:15.530 --> 00:00:17.140
He is not here.

7
00:00:17.190 --> 00:00:18.600
The women flee.

8
00:00:18.650 --> 00:00:22.190
They say nothing to anyone,
for they are afraid.

9
00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:26.210
The oldest complete manuscripts
of Mark end right there.

10
00:00:26.260 --> 00:00:29.640
Why would a Gospel end
on fear and silence?

11
00:00:29.690 --> 00:00:33.580
In this mission, you'll weigh up
explanations for the empty tomb.

12
00:00:33.630 --> 00:00:38.010
Then you'll see why Christians call the
resurrection central to their faith.

13
00:00:38.060 --> 00:00:42.920
Your mission: explore why Mark might
choose to end his Gospel at the tomb.
